==Battleground==
*3 [[Duche]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kenshin Himura (Enemy)|Kenshin Himura]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Rain D.]] spawns.
**1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is very annoying with the fast attacking boss outranging basically everything. At least 4 meatshields are recommended.

